SPOT DATA ATTRIBUTION AND LICENCE NOTICE

The included derived SPOT baseline results originate from:

Cottom, J. W., Cook, E. & Velis, C. A. (2026).
Spatio-temporal quantification of plastic pollution origins and transport (SPOT)
model - MFA Version 1.4.1-G-0426 [Dataset]. Zenodo.
https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22231994

The supplied source package states that, unless otherwise stated in an individual
file or source notice, its code, input data and model outputs are provided under
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Source-specific licence and copyright notices for reused third-party inputs
continue to apply. The explorer reorganizes selected released results into JSON,
charts and exports; it does not change the underlying model estimates.

This file preserves the supplied data attribution. It does not grant a separate
licence for the newly written explorer application, replace third-party terms,
or imply endorsement by the dataset authors. The application owner can add an
explicit software licence in a later release.
